- 30-45min
- Intermediate
- Gluten-Free
title: Herb Pork Tenderloin
method: oven
source: https://www.mccormickforchefs.com/en-us/recipes/entrees/herb-roasted-pork-tenderloin
protein: pork
ingredient_count: 4
---

Preheat #oven{} to 400ºF. Mix @McCormick Culinary Perfect Pinch Signature Seasoning Blend{2%tsps} and @McCormick Culinary Garlic{1%tsp}(minced) in #small bowl{}.

Sprinkle evenly over all sides of the @pork tenderloin{1 1/2%pounds}.

Heat @olive oil{1%tbsp} in #large skillet{} on medium heat. Sear tenderloin on all sides, finishing off in the oven until an internal temperature of 145ºF is reached.